{
  "bookId": "hero-213005",
  "id": "bond-28547",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28547001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "你这几天去哪了！我找你好几次，你都不在！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28547002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你找我有什么事情吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28547003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "我最近找到了一个好地方！特别好玩！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28547004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "那儿地势险要，地形复杂，特别适合约人干架！\n那里还有一条瀑布，打完架直接就可以去那洗澡！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28547005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28547006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "是不是特别完美！我可太喜欢那里了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28547007",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "所以，我准备给他的惊喜，竟然被他提前发现了吗……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28547008",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "可是，我准备送给他的攀岩基地，还没有完全做好啊！",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28547009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "走！我带你去看看！就在这边！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28547010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "呃……其实……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28547011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "我看那悬崖特别适合攀岩，喏，我给你做个示范！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28547012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "等等！涂料还没……干……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28547013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "……我粘住了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28547014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "你怎么看起来欲言又止，有话快说？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28547015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯，这其实是我给你的惊喜……\n总之，看见你这么「爱不释手」，我就放心了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28547016",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "我、谢、谢、你！所以，别拍照了！快放我下去！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
